/**
 * 0172 — Commercial Driver Study Centre, Study Library and company field training.
 *
 * Everything here is PREPARATION. LeaseOS practice and study do not issue a
 * provincial driver's licence, a road-test result, a Q endorsement, an H2S
 * Alive or First Aid certificate. Every course below carries that notice and
 * the external-track boundary, so `certificateDecision` refuses to issue from
 * it no matter who asks.
 *
 * The questions are ORIGINAL LeaseOS practice questions written against the
 * cited official publication. They are not government knowledge-test
 * questions and must never be presented as such. Each one names the source
 * and chapter it was written from, and the bank is version-locked to the
 * source edition: a new guide edition means a new course version, and old
 * attempts stay on the version they were taken against.
 *
 * Jurisdiction-aware: courses carry a jurisdiction and the sources carry
 * theirs. Saskatchewan, BC and others are added as new source records and new
 * course codes, not by editing Alberta's.
 */
